  "prefLabel": "Rev 710.02 Form DP-14 WS, Meals and Rentals Tax Worksheet",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 710.02 Form DP-14 WS, Meals and Rentals Tax Worksheet. Form DP-14 WS, “Meals and Rentals Tax Worksheet”, available in the publication of the New Hampshire meals and rentals tax booklet, which can be found at www.revenue.nh.gov, may be completed by operators while preparing to file their meals and rental tax returns electronically through the GTC website.\n\nSource. #10714, eff 11-7-14 (from Rev 708.02); ss by #14105, eff 10-29-24, EXPIRES: 10-29-34",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev700.html"
